<title>UK: S&amp;P assigns counterparty ratings to Landshypotek.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns counterparty ratings to Landshypotek.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Thursday it assigned its A minus long-term and A2 short-term counterparty rating to Landshypotek AB.</p>
<p>&quot;The outlook is stable,&quot; S&amp;P said in a statement.</p>
<p>--International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 4041</p>
</text>
